  "coverImage": "/assets/images/readytoconsume-bg.jpg",
"description": "\"Ready-to-consume is giving me anxiety\" is an editorial published in S2S Magazine, an indie publication that showcases students and recent graduates in fashion design in Spain. The project critically reflects on the fast pace at which we consume content in the digital age, translating that tension into the language of fashion. For this, garments from designers who graduated in 2024 from various Spanish schools and universities were used, highlighting the freshness and authenticity of their emerging perspectives.",
